IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. LON0045.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    COPY LON0045C.
01 WS-OUT-REC.
    05 MORT-INS-IND       PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    *> RATE ADJUSTMENT
    05 RATE-LOAD          PIC 9V9999 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM 3000-LTV-RULES
    DISPLAY "MORT-INS-IND=" MORT-INS-IND
    DISPLAY "RATE-LOAD=" RATE-LOAD
    STOP RUN.
3000-LTV-RULES.
    *>  OLD CHECK REMOVED 1996
    *>  IF LTV-RATIO > 64
    *>      PERFORM 9000-OLD-HANDLING
    *>  END-IF
    IF LTV-RATIO > 80
        MOVE 'Y' TO MORT-INS-IND
        MOVE 0.0050 TO RATE-LOAD
    ELSE
        MOVE 'N' TO MORT-INS-IND
    END-IF.
